# Package boundaries

- `@scalewing/tokens` is pure. No React, React Native, DOM, or CSS-in-JS runtime.
- `@scalewing/react` is DOM-only. Do not import `react-native`, Expo, or `@scalewing/react-native`.
- `@scalewing/react-native` is native-only. Do not import `react-dom`, CSS files, or `@scalewing/react`.
- Do not use React Native Web to share one component tree.
- Example apps consume public exports only. They are not a source of design tokens.
